<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Tennis-Hopman Cup results, day one.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Tennis-Hopman Cup results, day one.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results on the first day of the Hopman Cup mixed teams tennis tournament on Sunday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Group A</p>
<p>1-Croatia beat Australia 2-1</p>
<p>Singles (Croatian names first)</p>
<p>Iva Majoli beat Nicole Bradtke 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>Goran Ivanisevic lost to Mark Philippoussis 2-6 3-6</p>
<p>Doubles</p>
<p>Ivanisevic/Majoli beat Philippoussis/Bradtke 7-5 7-5.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
